          "quote": "尽量少用“精神病、妄想、控制、住院”"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00194",
          "explanation": "The doctor supplied brief, autonomy-preserving phrases for a frightened 18-year-old with monitored/control fears.",
          "quote": "我知道你现在很害怕。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
