          "quote": "不是控制你"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00038",
          "explanation": "The doctor acknowledged the feared cognitive/sedating side effect and linked it to observation and physician follow-up.",
          "quote": "你担心变笨/犯困我听到了"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The model distinguished addressable side-effect concerns from unsafe self-discontinuation and offered language the family could use directly.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00004",
          "explanation": "The doctor asked why the medication was refused, including whether it related to sedation/cognition fears.",
          "quote": "原因是困、怕变笨，还是坚决不肯"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00026",
          "explanation": "The family then revealed the refusal was tied to feeling controlled by medication.",
          "quote": "怕药控制脑子"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The model elicited and integrated the refusal meaning, but did not fully explore all higher-order details such as learning concerns, subjective slowing, or which family member was least triggering beyond the basic safety/medication assessment.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": false,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
  "important_non_chain_defect_assessment": {
    "category": "none",
